1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,259
WOMAN: Do you know if enough people have registered for the computer class?

2
00:00:03,259 --> 00:00:07,270
I have to let Mr. Terrance know whether the class is going to open or not.

3
00:00:07,270 --> 00:00:11,250
MEN: I checked the list earlier, and there were many who had already registered.

4
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:15,933
I think it's safe to tell Mr. Terrance that the class is going to be held.

5
00:00:15,933 --> 00:00:20,030
In fact, ask him if he would be interested in opening an extra class?

6
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:22,380
Registration lasts until this Friday

7
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:26,080
and I think there is a good chance that we could fill another class.

8
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:28,240
WOMAN: I think he would be happy to hear that

9
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:31,040
I will call him right away to see what he says.

10
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:36,290
MEN: Thanks, and could you also do me a favor and see how many people have registered for the cooking class?
